    "detailed_description": "NightFeed is a rogue-lite survival experience where you must attack and survive until the dawn breaks. Explore and search the large open-world style areas for secrets and hidden artifacts. You can play NightFeed alone or cooperatively with up to three other players (4-player co-op). <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718150/extras/4f9664a058afb88de8206aafdc251f1c.avif?t=1724974975\" width=800 height=300 /></span><br><br>Armed and protected with auras of dark magic, a coven of Shadow Hunters perform a nightly feed across the moors, consuming the dead and stealing their treasure and relics from centuries ago. <br><br>Ancient relics capable of crafting even stronger protection against the darkness that roams this black world, providing new and stronger experiences for the next <strong>NIGHTFEED...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718150/extras/3b8424ab53cba9a4d4d9478272bfa0b4.avif?t=1724974975\" width=800 height=400 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play online co-op or solo<br></li><li>Unlock stronger and powerful characters... including WEREWOLF!<br></li><li>Multiple open-world style maps to unlock... including Jurassic map with DINOSAURS!<br></li><li>Find hidden items and secrets<br></li><li>Complete random side-quests for more treasure, artifacts and gold<br></li><li>Challenging in-game achievements<br></li><li>Pumped up &quot;Killer&quot; soundtrack</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718150/extras/8944cc8ff2a540c98c8c9ab04ef5b38a.avif?t=1724974975\" width=286 height=176 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here's what a few Twitch streamers, who played an early version of NightFeed, are saying about the game...</h2><br><i><strong>&quot;10 out of 10. Would recommend!&quot;</strong></i> - ElanieMay<br><br><i><strong>&quot;This was super fun. I had a blast!&quot;</strong></i> - NinaStruggles<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Fun game....I enjoyed it.&quot;</strong></i> - Hook104<br><br><i><strong>&quot;I like it a lot!&quot;</strong></i> - Pooch<br><br><i><strong>&quot;This is going to get a positive review from me&quot;</strong></i> - Raimyah<br><br><i><strong>&quot;It's a beautiful game&quot;</strong></i> - Ayamewilson<br><br><i><strong>&quot;I had a good time... I am going to grind that **** offstream and unlock all the characters.&quot;</strong></i> - ArchTheCoolNerd<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Super fun... Super good...&quot;</strong></i> - Melleandris<br><br><i><strong>&quot;This was fantastic! Really had fun with this. Awesome game!&quot;</strong></i> - Anarky<br><br><i><strong>&quot;The game was really fun!!!&quot;</strong></i> - LaurenTheShort<br><br><i><strong>&quot;So much fun! I had a blast!&quot;</strong></i> - Reverend_Pickle<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Very impressed. I was having a good time with it!&quot;</strong></i> - MachineOsaur<br><br><i><strong>&quot;This was fun!&quot;</strong></i> - Crimson_VT<br><br><i><strong>&quot;was good!&quot;</strong></i> - N8tGr8N8<br><br><i><strong>&quot;I had a blast with this game. This game is very, very fun! I'm really enjoying it!&quot;</strong></i> - HazzieandNord<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Game was a blast!&quot;</strong></i> - SomberPuppet<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Can't wait to unlock all the characters!&quot;</strong></i> - YaotzinPrime<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Awesome!&quot;</strong></i> - Sheighlay<br><br><i><strong>&quot;Glad I got to try this out early. Pretty cool!&quot;</strong></i> - PrinnyHeroDood<br><br><i><strong>&quot;It's very enjoyable!&quot;</strong></i> - mitymidjt<br><br><i><strong>&quot;That was a lot of fun!&quot;</strong></i> - Chibishibe<br><br><i><strong>&quot;It's a lot of fun!&quot;</strong></i> - Backlogger07<br><b